{
	"Site": "Nexus",
	"Id": 15496,
	"Name": "Void Pig",
	"Author": "nadyeszti",
	"AuthorLabel": "Angelltear",
	"Description": "This mod adds a new animal shop entry: the void pig. With Ameyana's\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/11445]Void Barn Animals[/url]\u00A0 mod , SoftPandaBoi's [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/9776]Void Rabbits[/url], and my\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/14288]Void Duck[/url] now you can have all vanilla livestock in their darkest element (except dinosaurs, those are tricky).\n<br />\n<br />These dark pigs work the same as the original ones, just find their favorite snack, the tainted \"Void Truffle\", which can be processed in the Oil Maker into \"Void Truffle Oil\".\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />[size=4]Only download one of the files, or they will clash![/size]\n<br />\n<br />The main file only have the basic gray-with-red color that comes with the original void chickens. The glow version has a red glow.\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />OR\n<br />\n<br />I made an electric blue variety as well, for those who prefer that line. Comes with basic or glow version (in this case glows blue instead of red).\n<br />\n<br />OR\n<br />\n<br />You can download the file with both normal+glow (either blue or red) and then both variants shows up. In this case the glowing ones are called \"Charged Void Pig\".\n<br />\n<br />OR\n<br />\n<br />For animal collectors (like myself) can download the \"Void Pig Army\" file, which has all 4. In this special case Blue Void Pigs get their own shop entry, and their own produce (the Blue Void Truffle).\n<br />\n<br />The mod requires the unofficial version of BFAV",
	"PageUrl": "https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/15496",
